WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.776
This table summarizes the text half of the module
Use the simplest

00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:11.368
function that matches the actual problem Do not use
regex when TRIM

00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:17.004
solves the issue Do not use fixed positions when a
reliable delimiter

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:22.594
defines the structure And do not treat cleaning as
proof of validity

00:00:24.338 --> 00:00:28.061
Clear small transformations are easier to maintain
and explain
